diff --git a/features/servable-page.feature b/features/servable-page.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..b22441d
--- /dev/null
+++ b/features/servable-page.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+Feature: Servable page
+  As a user opening the todo app in a browser
+  I want index.html to render the full todo interface
+  So that I can interact with the application immediately
+
+  @contract
+  Scenario: index.html contains the required todo app structure
+    Given the project root has an "index.html" file
+    When the file is parsed as HTML
+    Then the document contains an element matching "section.todoapp"
+    And the document contains an element matching "input.new-todo"
+    And the document contains an element matching "section.main"
+    And the document contains an element matching "ul.todo-list"
+    And the document contains an element matching "footer.footer"
+
+  @contract
+  Scenario: index.html loads the application script
+    Given the project root has an "index.html" file
+    When the file is parsed as HTML
+    Then the document contains a script tag with source "js/app.js"
